#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Information about IBM Quantum on IBM Cloud logging"
msgstr "Información sobre el registro de eventos de IBM Quantum en IBM Cloud"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Logging for IBM Quantum Compute Service"
msgstr "Registro de eventos para IBM Quantum Compute Service"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Logging for IBM Quantum Compute Service {#logging-for-ibm-quantum-compute-service}"
msgstr "Registro de eventos para IBM Quantum Compute Service {#logging-for-ibm-quantum-compute-service}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Cloud&reg; services, such as IBM Quantum Compute Service, generate platform logs that you can use to investigate abnormal activity and critical actions in your account, and troubleshoot problems.\n"
msgstr "Los servicios de IBM Cloud&reg;, como IBM Quantum Compute Service, generan registros de plataforma que puedes usar para investigar actividad anómala y acciones críticas en tu cuenta, y para solucionar problemas.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use [IBM Cloud Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about), which is a platform service, to route platform logs in your account to a destination of your choice by configuring a tenant that defines where platform logs are sent. For more information, see [About Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about).\n"
msgstr "Puedes usar [IBM Cloud Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about), que es un servicio de plataforma, para enrutar los registros de plataforma de tu cuenta hacia el destino que elijas configurando un tenant que define a dónde se envían los registros de plataforma. Para más información, consulta [Acerca de Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use [IBM Cloud Logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs) to visualize and alert on platform logs that are generated in your account and routed by IBM Cloud Logs Routing to an IBM Cloud Logs instance.\n"
msgstr "Puedes usar [IBM Cloud Logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs) para visualizar y recibir alertas sobre los registros de plataforma que se generan en tu cuenta y que IBM Cloud Logs Routing enruta hacia una instancia de IBM Cloud Logs.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Locations where platform logs are generated {#locations-where-platform-logs-are-generated}"
msgstr "Ubicaciones donde se generan los registros de plataforma {#locations-where-platform-logs-are-generated}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Cloud Container Registry generates platform logs that are displayed in your logging instances. The following table lists the locations where the automatic collection of Container Registry service logs is enabled.\n"
msgstr "IBM Cloud Container Registry genera registros de plataforma que se muestran en tus instancias de registro. La siguiente tabla lista las ubicaciones donde está habilitada la recopilación automática de registros del servicio Container Registry.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Location                   | Are platform services logs available? |\n"
"|----------------------------|---------------------------------------|\n"
"| Washington, D.C. (us-east) |                  Yes                  |\n"
"| Frankfurt (eu-de)          |                  Yes                  |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Ubicación                  | ¿Hay registros de servicios de plataforma disponibles? |\n"
"|----------------------------|--------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| Washington, D.C. (us-east) |                          Sí                           |\n"
"| Frankfurt (eu-de)          |                          Sí                           |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Platform logs that are generated {#platform-logs-that-are-generated}"
msgstr "Registros de plataforma que se generan {#platform-logs-that-are-generated}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Compute Service generates platform services logs that are displayed in your logging instances for the following specific cases:\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum Compute Service genera registros de servicios de plataforma que se muestran en tus instancias de registro para los siguientes casos específicos:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "When the state of a job changes.\n"
msgstr "Cuando el estado de un job cambia.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Viewing logs from the Observability page {#viewing-logs-from-the-observability-page}"
msgstr "Ver registros desde la página de Observabilidad {#viewing-logs-from-the-observability-page}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For information about launching the IBM Cloud Logs interface, see **Launching the UI** in the [IBM Cloud Logs documentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch).\n"
msgstr "Para información sobre cómo abrir la interfaz de IBM Cloud Logs, consulta **Launching the UI** en la [documentación de IBM Cloud Logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fields by log type {#fields-by-log-type}"
msgstr "Campos por tipo de registro {#fields-by-log-type}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For information about fields included in every platform log, see [Fields that are included in platform logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about-platform-logs#about-platform-logs-2).\n"
msgstr "Para información sobre los campos incluidos en cada registro de plataforma, consulta [Fields that are included in platform logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about-platform-logs#about-platform-logs-2).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following fields are included in the log record.\n"
msgstr "Los siguientes campos están incluidos en el registro.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field           | Type     | Description                                                              |\n"
"|-----------------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| logSourceCRN    | Required | Defines the account and flow log instance where the log is published.    |\n"
"| saveServiceCopy | Required | Defines whether IBM saves a copy of the record for operational purposes. |\n"
"| message         | Required | Description of the log that is generated.                                |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Campo           | Tipo       | Descripción                                                                          |\n"
"|-----------------|------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| logSourceCRN    | Requerido  | Define la cuenta y la instancia de log de flujo donde se publica el registro.        |\n"
"| saveServiceCopy | Requerido  | Define si IBM guarda una copia del registro para fines operativos.                   |\n"
"| message         | Requerido  | Descripción del registro que se genera.                                              |\n"
